{"summary":"World’s 1st Solitaire with live cards! Klondike Solitaire gets a new design!","description":"World’s first Solitaire with live cards! Well-known and much-loved classic Klondike Solitaire gets new original design! The greatest way to escape from daily bustle wherever you are. Great graphics and relaxing background music add even more enjoyment to playing. \n\nFull ad-free version.\n\nYour goal is to group the cards (in 4 upper cells) according to their suites from aces till kings. Piles are built alternating red and black colors in sequence. Solitaire is also known as Klondike solitary, Patience.\n\n• Large, easy to manipulate cards\n• Full undo\n• Draw 1 and Draw 3 options\n• Hints\n• Tutorial\n• Smooth 3D animations\n• Relaxing background music\n• Sound effects and card animations adding fun to playing the game\n• Customized background\n• Standard and Vegas scoring\n• Google Play Games: leaderboards and achievements\n\nTry our other Solitare games: Spider Solitaire, Freecell Solitaire and Pyramid Solitaire!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qBZho4MQEvw?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Vzfc-yPCDQeY3lgTuEyqe2BmZWcPLAnIK1YxmfEyI1bt878EqmFRJ6PDvmGksbnhGjPGx15FvV0nbe0nwUvQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cn8lMwhjAMij0KppM69eITkzMWX5OK2oqSGqJ2G6V-LTG-a4D_ualOaMgRr-dMR2YaZOdwhlAkV5oTnWo0k8bA0","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rNgeahgdsX5tNhEFu5VLIA5pLuSf7z5XS6g0BlvE60-xvw55aE30ODE_Q-k0gU8HkMBH6ADWiQ5jp7ciqwI0","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/07fVWSOVJ7A3Rago0rjkBeO8qwxUKbsRI3IMLA92kXU3uy0zxVU3GMLJ-WgeQCD5oAjTOdYJD0MiwK44w6V5Jw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3LvUa4xMmh_fnKrly_kanHOAXb9LL0uftVE7a349i-xOk1vx7wg3KglsyhNYp0Oac7M3Mp724AiVbgu5sppIRg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RD4cOOsTrt41pfu-0_HFU9EH01dBfOjYNFplS0XkeaEPRXzvsek6-6DqZG29nN_UYjh_uPoY5uL5q4saMJf4FA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/l